    "detailed_description": "<h1>\ud83d\udd25 HELLBORN EARLY ACCESS \u2013 JOIN THE RITUAL NOW! \ud83d\udd25</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507930/extras/8b9558dee964549482895abc914c08c8.poster.avif?t=1754954797\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507930/extras/8b9558dee964549482895abc914c08c8.webm?t=1754954797\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507930/extras/8b9558dee964549482895abc914c08c8.mp4?t=1754954797\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The gates of hell have opened, and the nightmare begins. Get ready for an intense co-op horror experience where teamwork, strategy, and courage are your only hope for survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc7b Early Access Features Include:</strong> <br>\u2705 <strong>Online Co-Op (1-4 Players)</strong> \u2013 Face the terror together. <br>\u2705 <strong>Dynamic Haunting</strong> \u2013 The baby and possessed woman evolve, becoming more aggressive.  <br>\u2705 <strong>Sacrifices &amp; Rituals</strong> \u2013 Perform dark rites to weaken the demon. <br>\u2705 <strong>Unpredictable Horror</strong> \u2013 No two playthroughs are the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udce2 Join our Discord and shape the future of <i>Hellborn</i>!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dare to enter? The ritual awaits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enter a realm of terror where every shadow hides secrets waiting to be uncovered. In this intense co-op experience for up to four players, you'll explore a sprawling 50-room manor and descend into a sinister dungeon. The demon baby adds an unsettling presence to every dark corner. Engage in physics-based interactions, perform mysterious rituals, and search for elusive items and collectibles. Dare to step into the unknown and uncover the story that lurks behind every creaking door and eerie corridor.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\tCo-op Multiplayer: Team up with up to 4 players for a haunting experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\tExpansive Maps: Explore a sprawling 50-room manor and sinister dungeon depths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\tUnsettling Antagonists: Encounter a possessed woman and a demon baby that defy expectations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\tInteractive Environment: Engage with physics-based interactions and mysterious rituals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\tHidden Secrets: Search meticulously for rare items and collectibles that reveal the story.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507930/extras/6c1fd24030fb186354b09ab174e45325.poster.avif?t=1754954797\" width=800 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507930/extras/6c1fd24030fb186354b09ab174e45325.webm?t=1754954797\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507930/extras/6c1fd24030fb186354b09ab174e45325.mp4?t=1754954797\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The gates of hell have opened, and the nightmare begins. Get ready for an intense co-op horror experience where teamwork, strategy, and courage are your only hope for survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc7b Early Access Features Include:</strong> <br>\u2705 <strong>Online Co-Op (1-4 Players)</strong> \u2013 Face the terror together. <br>\u2705 <strong>Dynamic Haunting</strong> \u2013 The baby and possessed woman evolve, becoming more aggressive.  <br>\u2705 <strong>Sacrifices &amp; Rituals</strong> \u2013 Perform dark rites to weaken the demon. <br>\u2705 <strong>Unpredictable Horror</strong> \u2013 No two playthroughs are the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udce2 Join our Discord and shape the future of <i>Hellborn</i>!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dare to enter? The ritual awaits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enter a realm of terror where every shadow hides secrets waiting to be uncovered. In this intense co-op experience for up to four players, you'll explore a sprawling 50-room manor and descend into a sinister dungeon. The demon baby adds an unsettling presence to every dark corner. Engage in physics-based interactions, perform mysterious rituals, and search for elusive items and collectibles. Dare to step into the unknown and uncover the story that lurks behind every creaking door and eerie corridor.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\tCo-op Multiplayer: Team up with up to 4 players for a haunting experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\tExpansive Maps: Explore a sprawling 50-room manor and sinister dungeon depths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\tUnsettling Antagonists: Encounter a possessed woman and a demon baby that defy expectations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\tInteractive Environment: Engage with physics-based interactions and mysterious rituals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\tHidden Secrets: Search meticulously for rare items and collectibles that reveal the story.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507930/extras/6c1fd24030fb186354b09ab174e45325.poster.avif?t=1754954797\" width=800 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507930/extras/6c1fd24030fb186354b09ab174e45325.webm?t=1754954797\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507930/extras/6c1fd24030fb186354b09ab174e45325.mp4?t=1754954797\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
